+## Claim (formal)
+Maintain a GH registry with fields: locus (span), concept context, needed operator/variable (e.g., Tx), attempted resolutions, status, next review time. GH are revisited until resolved or declared non‑closure.
+
+## Philosophical Translation (of formal claim)
+Gaps are first-class citizens: we log them, track them, and return with better structure.
+
+## Pseudocode
+```text
+def log_GH(step, concept, needed):
+    registry.append({
+        "locus": step,
+        "concept": concept,
+        "needed": needed,
+        "status": "open",
+        "next": schedule_review()
+    })
+```
+
+## Clarifications / Further Context
+- Registry lives alongside statements; review cadence is part of breath cycles.
