 ## Derivation (Formal/Operational)
 ```text
 trigger = (pressure_t > τ_pressure) ∧ (MDL_gain_t > 0)
 born_variable := trigger ? 1 : 0
 ```
 with telemetry: mdl_gain, pressure.
 
+## Derivation (Philosophical)
