 Config toggles:
 - `inject_co: true|false` (default true; disables CO injection when false)
 - `co_manifest: <path>` (optional override; resolved relative to the suite config file)
 - `max_workers: <int>` (default 1)
 - `parallelize_by: "run"|"mode"` (default "run")
 - `continue_on_failure: true|false` (default true)
 - `rerun_failed_only: true|false` (default false)
+- `suffix_out_root: true|false` (default true; when true and `--config` is used, appends a timestamp suffix)
